    "text": "TikTok Shop US Division Sees Another Round of Layoffs\nBy PYMNTS,\n8 hours agoThe company did not say how many jobs were cut, Bloomberg reported Wednesday (July 2). “As the TikTok Shop business evolves, we regularly review our operations to ensure long-term success,” a TikTok spokesperson said in the report. “We’ve made the difficult decision to adjust parts of our team to better align with strategic priorities.”",
